@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Block admission\nand network delivery" as ADMISSION #E3F2FD
component "Request sequencer\nSeqCst tickets" as REQUESTS #BBDEFB
component "Worker A\nimmutable evaluation" as WORKER_A #C8E6C9
component "Worker B\nimmutable evaluation" as WORKER_B #C8E6C9
database "Finalization ledger\nround + head transaction" as LEDGER #FFE082
database "Immutable genesis anchor\nhash · height · root digest" as GENESIS #FFD54F
component "Ordered metadata\nprojection" as PROJECTION #FFCCBC
component "Idempotent effects\ndeploy · cosigner · cache · event" as EFFECTS #D1C4E9
database "Durable cursors\nprojection · effects · compaction" as CURSORS #FFF9C4
component "Changed predecessor\nstale · fresh evaluation\nno state change" as STALE #FFCDD2

ADMISSION --> REQUESTS : nonblocking request
REQUESTS --> WORKER_A : bounded permit
REQUESTS --> WORKER_B : bounded permit
LEDGER --> WORKER_A : bind revision · block · height · digest
LEDGER --> WORKER_B : bind revision · block · height · digest
ADMISSION -[dashed]-> WORKER_A : continues concurrently
ADMISSION -[dashed]-> WORKER_B : continues concurrently
WORKER_A --> LEDGER : revalidate ancestry + state\ncompare-and-append exact base
WORKER_B --> LEDGER : revalidate ancestry + state\ncompare-and-append exact base
GENESIS --> LEDGER : roots every round digest
LEDGER --> GENESIS : exact retry verifies only\nnever overwrites or resets head
LEDGER --> PROJECTION : winning immutable manifest
LEDGER --> STALE : mismatched predecessor
PROJECTION --> CURSORS : advance contiguous projection
PROJECTION --> EFFECTS : only after durable projection
EFFECTS --> CURSORS : receipts and completion marker
CURSORS --> EFFECTS : retry unfinished suffix after restart
CURSORS -[dashed]-> GENESIS : bootstrap together atomically

note bottom of LEDGER #FFFDE7
Only the constant-size publication point is linearized.
Clique evaluation, replay, admission, and network work remain parallel.
Startup audits the full rooted chain; ordinary genesis retries are O(1).
end note
@enduml
